reagent-name-coldscales = Coldscales
reagent-desc-coldscales = A cool, pale-green drink favored by scaled crew. Smells faintly of a reptile enclosure.

reagent-name-oil-drum = Oil Drum
reagent-desc-oil-drum = Industrial lubricant cut with ethanol into something vaguely drinkable. Somehow not toxic. Somehow.

reagent-name-nord-king = Nord King
reagent-desc-nord-king = A strong mead thickened with honey and extra spirit, dripped straight from the keg. Dwarven patrons swear by it.

reagent-name-velvet-kiss = Velvet Kiss
reagent-desc-velvet-kiss = A deep red drink mixed with wine, said to be favored by the station's pale and night-shift inclined.

reagent-name-abduction-fruit = Abduction Fruit
reagent-desc-abduction-fruit = A blend of fruit juices meant to approximate an unearthly flavor. Rumor has it the recipe was reverse-engineered from an abductee's tray.

reagent-name-bug-zapper = Bug Zapper
reagent-desc-bug-zapper = Copper shavings, lemon juice, and a faint electrical tang. Hardly even a drink.

reagent-name-mush-crush = Mush Crush
reagent-desc-mush-crush = Essentially soil in a glass, popular with crew who'd rather grow their own food than drink it.

reagent-name-darkbrew = Darkbrew
reagent-desc-darkbrew = A pitch-black brew that's commonly mistaken for very strong coffee. It isn't.

reagent-name-hollow-bone = Hollow Bone
reagent-desc-hollow-bone = A shockingly non-harmful mix of milk and something that should probably hurt more than it does.

reagent-name-frisky-kitty = Frisky Kitty
reagent-desc-frisky-kitty = Warm milk steeped with catnip. Entirely harmless, probably.

reagent-name-jell-wyrm = Jell Wyrm
reagent-desc-jell-wyrm = A fizzy, faintly toxic concoction meant for crew with a less conventional metabolism.

reagent-name-laval-spit = Laval Spit
reagent-desc-laval-spit = A piping-hot mineral drink that tastes like scorched stone. Best served molten.
